   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Pronunciation of special groups",
     "texto": [
      "The digraph **gn** sounds exactly like the «ny» in «canyon»: **bagno**, **signora**, **Spagna**. The g and the n are never pronounced separately.",
      "The trigraph **gli** sounds like the «lli» in «million»: **figlio**, **famiglia**, the article **gli**.",
      "The group **sc** before **e, i** sounds like «sh»: **scusi**, **scena**, **pesce**. Before a, o, u it sounds like «sk»: **scala**, **scuola**.",
      "The group **qu** is always pronounced /kw/, with the «u» clearly audible: **qui**, **questo**, **quattro**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
